This small building, a house and a laboratory at the same time, hanged with antennas from all sides, belongs to Nikolas Swift - a very respectable citizen of Mech-City. Though, he is strange like all other scholars are, but he knows a lot. There are also many interesting, technical things in his laboratory; they are so fascinating to boys. When you come to the door, it opens by itself, inviting you to enter. You wonder how Nikolas' devices know that you are here? 